{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>ומרדף</b> — a transitive verb." "<b>וריקים</b> — these are the pursued ones, and the pursuit is the swiftness to walk after them empty, for they are poor people who have nothing. So too: 'נעור וריק' (shaken out and empty)."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:25:15.389385437Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}